cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Geometrycycles: geometric cycle detection and entropy/eigenvalue analysis for dynamical-system attractors"
abstract: >
  Code accompanying the paper "Equation free data-driven modelling of chaotic processes".
  Detects geometric cycles in a sampled attractor, selects representative
  cycles, and computes entropy plateau, cross-correlations, and eigenvalues
  of the resulting transition structure.
